      "content": "i tried calling the clinic but it's after hours and i'm honestly pretty scared to go to the ER if it's not a big deal. the swelling is mostly just in my calf and it doesn't really hurt that bad, it's just uncomfortable. do you think it could just be the meds or the swelling from the actual surgery? it's probably fine to just wait until morning right?",
