      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll try to sleep on it and see. i have some leftover ibuprofen and some extra strength aspirin in my cabinet, would it be a good idea to take some of both to help with the swelling and the tightness? i want to make sure the inflammation goes down so i don't have to worry about it in the morning.",
